{"version":1,"content":"<p>警方拘捕一名50歲本地男子，涉為爆竊集團主腦，涉及至少兩宗於重陽節長假期、發生於大埔樟樹灘村及黃宜坳村的爆竊案。</p><p>兩案財物總損失共約4萬元，警方暫時已起回大部份失物，包括9支總值約2.7萬元的酒及約9000元現金。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T13:17:43.382967+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:49:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T14:18:09.720314+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T13:17:43.382967+00:00","content_hash":"ec6332dd97638936eeedf9258b562f82d572e8c806a571f1983596fef3dd9f80","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}